-- The comments are rewritten by sync.
return {
	-- Guide
	["Bloodsail Buccaneers Reputation"] = "血帆海盜聲望",
	-- {item:10030} Admiral's Hat · {area:35} Booty Bay
	["The pirate outfit and the {item:10030}, bought with a war against {area:35} and every goblin town."] = "海盜套裝和{item:10030}，是用與{area:35}及所有哥布林城鎮為敵的戰爭換來的。",

	-- Step 1: Before you start
	["Before you start"] = "開始之前",
	-- {area:35} Booty Bay · {area:976} Gadgetzan · {area:392} Ratchet · {area:2255} Everlook
	["Bloodsail standing goes up only by killing the people of {area:35}, and every kill costs you {area:35} 125 and the other goblin towns ({area:976}, {area:392}, {area:2255}, and in Forever likely Powderfuse) about 62 each. After the Bruisers this guide asks for, every goblin town is Hated: their guards attack you, and you lose their flight masters, inns, vendors and {area:976}'s and {area:2255}'s auction houses. Getting back takes longer than getting here (last step). Fly in, bind elsewhere, and do your goblin-town business first. The outfit and the hat need only Friendly; past that Bloodsail has nothing to give. {area:35}'s guards are not your enemies yet: tick At War for {area:35} in your reputation panel, then attack."] = "血帆聲望只能透過殺{area:35}的人來提升，而每殺一個都會讓你損失{area:35} 125點和其它哥布林城鎮（{area:976}、{area:392}、{area:2255}，在Forever中很可能還有火藥鎮）各約62點。完成本指南要求的打手擊殺後，所有哥布林城鎮都會變為仇恨：衛兵會攻擊你，你也會失去它們的飛行管理員、旅店、商人，以及{area:976}和{area:2255}的拍賣行。挽回這些比走到這裡更費時（見最後一步）。飛進來，把爐石綁在別處，並先辦完你在各大哥布林城鎮的事務。套裝和帽子只需友善；再往後血帆就沒有什麼可給的了。{area:35}的衛兵現在還不是你的敵人：在聲望面板中為{area:35}勾選“交戰”，然後再動手。",

	-- Step 2: Booty Bay Bruisers to Neutral
	-- plural, as words: Booty Bay Bruisers = {npc:4624} Booty Bay Bruiser
	["Booty Bay Bruisers to Neutral"] = "靠藏寶海灣打手到中立",
	-- {area:35} Booty Bay · {area:327} Faldir's Cove · {zone:1417} Arathi Highlands
	["Look at your Bloodsail bar first. A new character starts Hated, 500 short of Hostile: 260 Bruisers to Neutral, at 25 each. But every {area:35} quest you did while leveling took five times its {area:35} reward off Bloodsail (An OOX of Your Own, Stranglethorn Fever and Facing Negolash 1,000 each), and every Bloodsail pirate you killed 25 more: after {area:35}'s quests you sit near the bottom of Hated, up to 1,680 Bruisers from Neutral. Divide what the bar still lacks to Hostile, plus 6,000, by 25. Bruisers (level 57) hit hard, net you and knock you back, and new ones come when a goblin calls for help. Fight on the path that turns left from the tunnel up to the blacksmith's house: two Bruisers patrol it and rarely meet. Once they are down, step into the house (or hit one of the goblins inside) and a fresh Bruiser comes running. Players manage 30 to 40 an hour. {area:35} is Hated after about 53 Bruisers from a fresh Neutral 500. At the New Year celebration the town's goblins are drunk and do not fight back. The Blackwater crew at {area:327} in the {zone:1417} (level 37-40) are easier but pay only 5 each. Do not kill Bloodsail pirates: each costs 25."] = "先看看你的血帆聲望條。新角色從仇恨開始，離敵對差500點：殺260個打手可到中立，每個25點。但你在升級時做過的每個{area:35}任務都會按它{area:35}獎勵的五倍扣除血帆聲望（“你自己的OOX”、“荊棘谷熱病”和“直面奈古拉什”各1,000點），而且每殺一個血帆海盜還要再扣25點：做完{area:35}的任務後，你會落在仇恨的最底端，離中立最多要殺1,680個打手。把聲望條離敵對還差的部分加上6,000，再除以25。打手（57級）打得疼，會用網困住你並把你擊退，而且哥布林一呼救就會來新的。在從隧道向上通往鐵匠住宅的岔路左轉那條路上打：兩個打手在那裡巡邏，很少撞在一起。把他們放倒後，走進屋子（或打裡面的一個哥布林），就會有一個新打手跑來。玩家每小時能打30到40個。從全新的中立500起，約殺53個打手後{area:35}就會變成仇恨。新年慶典時，鎮上的哥布林喝醉了，不會還手。{zone:1417}中{area:327}的黑水船員（37-40級）更容易，但每個只給5點。不要殺血帆海盜：每個扣25點。",
	["the path to the smithy"] = "通往鐵匠鋪的小路",

