	-- {npc:2546} Fleet Master Firallon · {area:1757} Crimson Veil · {area:35} Booty Bay · {item:22746} Buccaneer's Uniform · {item:22742} Bloodsail Shirt
	["At Neutral the Bloodsail crew stop attacking you. {npc:2546} is aboard the {area:1757}, the pirate ship anchored south of {area:35}, on its middle deck. Swim out; take the quest and hand it in on the spot for the {item:22746}: the {item:22742}, Sash, Pants and Boots."] = "到中立後，血帆船員不再攻擊你。{npc:2546}在{area:1757}上，那是停泊在{area:35}以南的海盜船，他在中層甲板。游過去；接任務並當場交回，換取{item:22746}：{item:22742}、腰帶、褲子和靴子。",
	-- {npc:2546} Fleet Master Firallon · {item:22746} Buccaneer's Uniform
	["{npc:2546}: the {item:22746}"] = "{npc:2546}：{item:22746}",

	-- Step 4: Bruisers to Friendly
	["Bruisers to Friendly"] = "靠打手到友善",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 more: 120 Bruisers. Friendly is the last standing that unlocks anything."] = "中立到友善還需3,000點：120個打手。友善是最後一個能解鎖東西的聲望等級。",

	-- Step 5: Avast Ye, Scallywag
	-- {area:35} Booty Bay
	["\"Pretty Boy\" Duncan, a Bloodsail pirate, stands on the beach north of {area:35}. {area:35} players kill him for a quest: if he is not there, wait for him. He has a quest for you from level 55, while {area:35} is below Neutral; it is done once you are Friendly with the Bloodsail and Hated with {area:35}."] = "血帆海盜“小白臉”鄧肯站在{area:35}以北的海灘上。{area:35}的玩家會為任務殺他：如果他不在，就等他。55級起他會給你一個任務，前提是{area:35}聲望低於中立；當你與血帆達到友善、與{area:35}達到仇恨時才算完成。",
	-- {npc:2546} Fleet Master Firallon · {area:1757} Crimson Veil
	["{npc:2546}, on the {area:1757}: 25"] = "{npc:2546}，在{area:1757}上：25",

	-- Step 6: Avast Ye, Admiral!
	-- {npc:2496} Baron Revilgaz · {npc:2487} Fleet Master Seahorn · {area:35} Booty Bay
	["{npc:2496} and {npc:2487} stand on the top floor of the {area:35} inn, out on the balcony. Both are level 60 and Bruisers come to their aid: clear the stairs first and pull them one at a time. They come back, so a friend can kill them too."] = "{npc:2496}和{npc:2487}站在{area:35}旅店的頂層，在陽臺上。兩人都是60級，而且打手會來幫他們：先清乾淨樓梯，再一個一個拉。他們會復活，所以朋友也能來殺。",

	-- Step 7: The Admiral's Hat
	-- {item:10030} Admiral's Hat
