	-- {item:12185} Bloodsail Admiral's Hat · {area:35} Booty Bay · {zone:1418} Badlands
	["Back to Firallon for the {item:12185} (in Classic its use calls a parrot to your shoulder): 200 more Bloodsail and 1,000 less {area:35}. Bruisers pay 25 only up to the end of Honored and Jazzrik, a lone goblin in the {zone:1418}, 5 up to the end of Revered; no quest is left, so Exalted cannot be reached."] = "回到菲拉隆處拿{item:12185}（經典舊世中，使用它會召喚一隻鸚鵡停在肩上）：血帆聲望再加200，{area:35}聲望再減1,000。打手只在尊敬結束前每次給25點，而{zone:1418}中獨行的哥布林Jazzrik在崇敬結束前每次給5點；已無任務可做，所以無法達到崇拜。",

	-- Step 8: The way back
	["The way back"] = "挽回之路",
	-- {area:392} Ratchet · {area:35} Booty Bay · {area:976} Gadgetzan · {area:2255} Everlook · {npc:14637} Zorbin Fandazzle · {zone:1444} Feralas
	["Every goblin town is now Hated. Forever's quest data takes the town reputation off the four goblin amends quests outside {area:392}, {area:35}, {area:976} and {area:2255}, so the climb back is the Cartel's own: {npc:14637} in {zone:1444} serves everyone, and his Zapped Giants quests pay 25 to every town at once; Bloodsail pirates give {area:35} 5 each up to the end of Neutral (and cost Bloodsail 25); Southsea pirates and the Venture Co. in Stranglethorn give the towns 5 each. The Steamwheedle Cartel guide has the details. Expect it to take longer than the war did."] = "現在所有哥布林城鎮都是仇恨。Forever的任務資料把城鎮聲望從{area:392}、{area:35}、{area:976}和{area:2255}外的四個哥布林補償任務中移除了，所以挽回之路只能靠財團自己：{zone:1444}的{npc:14637}面向所有人服務，他的“電擊巨人”任務會一次性給每個城鎮25點；血帆海盜在中立結束前每次給{area:35} 5點（並扣血帆25點）；荊棘谷的南海海盜和風險投資公司每次給各城鎮5點。熱砂財團指南有詳細說明。做好它比那場戰爭花的時間更長的準備。",
	-- {npc:14637} Zorbin Fandazzle
	["{npc:14637}: Zapped Giants, open to the Hated"] = "{npc:14637}：“電擊巨人”，對仇恨者開放",
